{"articleNo":"54692","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=54692&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2012 여름계절수업 타대학(군산대) 수학신청 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2012.05.03","hit":"6753","attachments":[{"name":"시간표(군산대).xls","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=54692&attachNo=2120"},{"name":"명단서식(군산대).xls","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=54692&attachNo=2202"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><!--StartFragment--> </p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 300%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 19pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 300%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><img height=\"44\" src=\"file:///C:/DOCUME~1/user/LOCALS~1/Temp/UNI00000d50813a.gif\" width=\"517\" border=\"0\"></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\">1. 계절수업 추진 일정&nbsp; </span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 수업기간 : 2012. 6. 21(목) ~ 2012. 7. 11(수)</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 수학 희망자 추천 : 2012. 5. 11(금)까지</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;다. 성적열람 및 이의신청 : 2012. 7. 16(월) ~ 7. 17(화) 18:00까지</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;라. 성적통보일 : 2012. 7. 19(목) 예정</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\">2. </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\">지원자격</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\"> : </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'; LETTER-SPACING: 1.3pt\">본교와 학술교류협정을 체결한 대학의 재학생으로서 소속 대학교&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'; LETTER-SPACING: 1.3pt\">총장의</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\"> 추천을 받은자</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\">3. 수강신청 및 수강료 납부</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 수강료 </span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;① 교양 및 전공교과목 : 학점당 30,000원</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;② 교직교과목 : 학점당 35,000원</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 수강신청 및 수강료 납부기간 : </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">2012. 5. 16(수) ~ 5. 21(월) 16:00까지</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;다. 수강신청 절차</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;① 군</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt\">산대학교 홈페이지(</span><a href=\"http://www.kunsan.ac.kr)？종합정보시스템？학사서비스/\" target=\"_self\"><font color=\"#0000ff\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt; TEXT-DECORATION: none\">www.kunsan.ac.kr) </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'; TEXT-DECORATION: none\">접속</span></font></a></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;② 종합정보시스템？학사서비스？수강관리？계절수업 수강신청&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 아이디 : 군산대학교에서 부여한 학번 </span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 비밀번호 : 초기비밀번호는 주민등록번호 뒤 7자리</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;라. 수강료 납부 : 고지서 출력 후 본인의 가상계좌(전북은행)로 수강료 납부</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;마. 수</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt\">강 취소 : 수강취소자는 군산대학교 수업관리규정 제43조에 의거 수강료 반환</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt\"></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\">4. 교과목 폐강 : 다른 교과목으</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\">로 변경 또는 수강료 반환 처리</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 교양 및 전공교과목 : 수강인원이 20명 미만일 경우 폐강</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 교직교과목 : 수강인원이 10명 미만일 경우 폐강</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\">5. 취득학점 처리</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 학생이 취득한 학점은 본교의 학칙 및 규정에 따라 처리함.</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 수업시간수 4분의 3이상을 출석하여야 성적을 인정함.</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;다. 교과목 이수단위는 학점으로 하며, 1학점당 15시간 이상으로 함.</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;(단, 실험？실습？실기교과목은 30시간 이상의 수업을 1학점) </span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;라. 성적부여 및 평가 : 100점 만점으로 환산하며, 전교과목 상대평가 적용함.</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;마. 성적열람 및 이의신청 : 2012. 7. 16(월) ~ 7. 17(화) 18:00까지</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;〔조회방법 : 군산대학교 → 종합정보시스템 → 학사서비스 → 성적관리〕</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\">6. 타대학 수학 신청시 유의사항</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 선수과목이 필요한 과목을 신청할 경우 선수과목 이수여부를 확인한 후 신청</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 8학기차(건축학 10학기차) 재학생 및 2012-1학기 타대학 편입학 에정자는 타대학수학신청 불가</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;다. 이미 이수한 교과목과 동일한 교과목이 확점은 인정하지 않음.(재수강 불가)</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;※ 붙임파일 : 1. 시간표 </span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2. 신청명단 서식</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
